# Get a month's summary. Start the API with Aspire first, then send "Create an account" once.
@host = http://localhost:5279

### Create an account → 201. The requests below use its access token.
# @name createAccount
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user-{{$guid}}@example.com",
  "password": "password",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Zagreb"
}

### A month → 200. A new account has no routines, so its counts are zero.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/month-summaries/2026-11
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Not a month → 400 validation.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/month-summaries/2026-13
Authorization: Bearer {{createAccount.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Not signed in → 401 unauthorized.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/month-summaries/2026-11
